<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<task id="180" project="spaarke-ontology-platform-r1">
  <metadata>
    <title>Event, To Do, Invoice and Report Card Enter Info steps use the side-pane lookup for person and organization fields</title>
    <phase>12 Create-wizard lookups and composer (UAT round 4)</phase>
    <gate>after 179 (shares the Event, Invoice and Report Card wizard files)</gate>
    <status>not-started</status>
    <rigor>FULL</rigor>
    <rigor-reason>Modifies shared client code (.ts/.tsx) used by several wizards.</rigor-reason>
    <model-tier>sonnet</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>Same wiring as 179 applied to four steps, with an exact reference.</model-tier-reason>
    <effort>high</effort>
    <parallel-group>none</parallel-group>
    <parallel-safe>false</parallel-safe>
    <parallel-reason>file-overlap with task 179 (CreateEventWizard.tsx, CreateInvoiceWizard.tsx, CreateReportCardWizard.tsx)</parallel-reason>
    <deps>178, 179</deps>
    <tags>frontend, react, fluent-ui, testing</tags>
    <estimated-effort>3-4 hours</estimated-effort>
  </metadata>
  <prompt>Apply the side-pane lookup to the person and organization fields of the Event, To Do, Invoice and Report Card Enter Info steps (review section 2.1), so the create wizards stop mixing inline and side-pane lookups.</prompt>
  <role>SPAARKE platform developer. Follow ADRs strictly. Expert in React, Fluent UI v9 and the @spaarke/ui-components wizard framework (CreateRecordWizard, WizardShell).</role>
  <goal>Event Assigned To, To Do Assigned To, Invoice Vendor Organization and the eight Report Card person/firm fields render with DataverseLookupField over the host navigationService; the Create Event and Add To Do follow-ons inherit it.</goal>
  <context>
    <background>Review section 2.1 rows for CreateEventStep.tsx:250, CreateTodoStep.tsx:192 (TodoWizardDialog.tsx:218), CreateInvoiceStep.tsx:241, CreateReportCardStep.tsx:264-326; follow-on wrappers CreateEventFollowOnStep.tsx:87 and AddTodoFollowOnStep.tsx:85. All four wizards already receive a navigationService.</background>
    <relevant-files>
      <file role="modify">src/client/shared/Spaarke.UI.Components/src/components/CreateEventWizard/CreateEventStep.tsx</file>
      <file role="modify">src/client/shared/Spaarke.UI.Components/src/components/CreateTodoWizard/CreateTodoStep.tsx</file>
      <file role="modify">src/client/shared/Spaarke.UI.Components/src/components/CreateInvoiceWizard/CreateInvoiceStep.tsx</file>
      <file role="modify">src/client/shared/Spaarke.UI.Components/src/components/CreateReportCardWizard/CreateReportCardStep.tsx</file>
      <file role="modify">src/client/shared/Spaarke.UI.Components/src/components/WizardFollowOns/steps/CreateEventFollowOnStep.tsx</file>
      <file role="modify">src/client/shared/Spaarke.UI.Components/src/components/WizardFollowOns/steps/AddTodoFollowOnStep.tsx</file>
      <file role="modify">src/client/shared/Spaarke.UI.Components/src/components/CreateEventWizard/CreateEventWizard.tsx</file>
      <file role="modify">src/client/shared/Spaarke.UI.Components/src/components/CreateInvoiceWizard/CreateInvoiceWizard.tsx</file>
      <file role="modify">src/client/shared/Spaarke.UI.Components/src/components/CreateReportCardWizard/CreateReportCardWizard.tsx</file>
      <file role="modify">src/client/shared/Spaarke.UI.Components/src/components/CreateTodoWizard/TodoWizardDialog.tsx</file>
      <file role="canonical-reference">src/client/shared/Spaarke.UI.Components/src/components/CreateProjectWizard/CreateProjectStep.tsx</file>
    </relevant-files>
    <dependencies>
      <dependency task="178" status="pending">DataverseLookupField hardening</dependency>
      <dependency task="179" status="pending">navigationService on the CreateRecordWizard config</dependency>
    </dependencies>
  </context>
  <constraints>
    <constraint source="owner">Owner directive 2026-11-12, applies to every file this task touches: reuse the existing side-pane lookup (`DataverseLookupField` over `INavigationService.openLookup`) and the existing `EmailComposer`; never re-create either. A third rendering of the lookup pattern is a defect (review section 4 item 6).</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-012">Every component changed in this task stays in `@spaarke/ui-components` and receives Dataverse access only through injected services (`INavigationService`, `IDataService`, `authenticatedFetch`).</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-021">Every UI change in this task uses Fluent v9 and semantic tokens only; light and dark both fully themed.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-038">Tests added in this task cover the stated contract plus the edge cases named in the acceptance criteria; anything beyond needs a one-line justification in the task notes. No numeric test target.</constraint>
    <constraint source="owner">Owner D-219 (2026-11-12, notes/decisions.md) Q1: every lookup uses the side pane, reference tables included (Matter Type, Practice Area, Event Type, other *_ref tables); only option sets stay dropdowns. The pane entityType is the table the field's current search already queries.</constraint>
    <constraint source="owner">Every contact (person) field converted in this task passes `filters` limiting the pane to active contacts: [{ entityLogicalName: "contact", filterXml: '&lt;filter&gt;&lt;condition attribute="statecode" operator="eq" value="0"/&gt;&lt;/filter&gt;' }] (Owner D-219 (2026-11-12, notes/decisions.md) Q6). Put this filter in ONE exported constant beside DataverseLookupField and import it; do not copy the XML.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Scope: the lookup fields of these four steps listed in review section 2.1, including Event Type (CreateEventStep.tsx:221).</constraint>
  </constraints>
  <knowledge>
    <files>
      <file>.claude/constraints/pcf.md</file>
      <file>.claude/patterns/pcf/control-initialization.md</file>
      <file>.claude/patterns/pcf/theme-management.md</file>
